    },
    {
      "en": "Today let's begin with note-taking techniques.",
      "asr_range": [
        1781,
        1788
      ],
      "start": 928.79,
      "end": 931.91
    },
    {
      "en": "Note-taking is an important skill not only for taking classes, but also for doing your job in the future.",
      "asr_range": [
        1788,
        1808
      ],
      "start": 932.15,
      "end": 939.35
    },
    {
      "en": "I'd like to draw your attention to certain points about taking notes.",
      "asr_range": [
        1808,
        1820
      ],
      "start": 939.59,
      "end": 943.51
    },
    {
      "en": "First, remember that note-taking should be 75% listening and only 25% writing.",
      "asr_range": [
        1820,
        1832
      ],
      "start": 944.11,
      "end": 950.99
    },
    {
      "en": "So don't try to write down every single word the teacher says.",
      "asr_range": [
        1832,
        1844
      ],
      "start": 951.23,
      "end": 954.83
    },
    {
      "en": "Ignore what is unimportant and write in phrases, not complete sentences.",
      "asr_range": [
        1844,
        1855
      ],
      "start": 955.07,
      "end": 960.11
    },
    {
      "en": "Second, leave spaces and lines between main ideas.",
      "asr_range": [
        1855,
        1863
      ],
      "start": 960.35,
      "end": 964.27
    },
    {
      "en": "You may want to add some information later.",
      "asr_range": [
        1863,
        1871
      ],
      "start": 964.51,
      "end": 966.91
    },
    {
      "en": "I find that some of you are very good at making use of colour, mapping web, and symbols such as arrows, circles, and boxes.",
      "asr_range": [
        1871,
        1895
      ],
      "start": 967.64,
      "end": 975.56
    },
    {
      "en": "I highly recommend these tools to all of you, because the use of them makes the outline more easily readable and interesting than the blocks of text.",
      "asr_range": [
        1895,
        1922
      ],
      "start": 975.8,
      "end": 984.84
    },
    {
      "en": "It also makes sure that important words stand out.",
      "asr_range": [
        1922,
